{{JPExclusive}}
'''Clone Elle''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be unlocked by using a serial code during the [[Million Arthur Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.4 Update|Version 2.2.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 101
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Clone Elle
|name2 = Clone Elle CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Clone Elle CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is immediately outclassed upon obtaining [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]]. With superior durability and DPS, Axe Cat so thoroughly outperforms Clone Elle that the latter's Area Attack hardly matters in the long run. The fact that even Axe Cat eventually gets replaced by [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] and the latter has decent talents purchasable later on only cement Clone Elle's obsolescence.

